WEBVTT

00:00:13.317 --> 00:00:17.191
[ soft, eerie whirring]

00:00:17.234 --> 00:00:19.671
[ soft whimsical music playing]

00:00:19.715 --> 00:00:22.283
[ dog barks]

00:00:27.984 --> 00:00:32.684
[ thunder softly rumbling]

00:00:32.728 --> 00:00:35.644
HARRY POTTER [ whispering]:
Lumos Maxima.

00:00:36.601 --> 00:00:40.170
Lumos Maxima.

00:00:43.173 --> 00:00:46.307
[ toilet flushing]

00:00:54.532 --> 00:00:57.535
♪

00:00:59.929 --> 00:01:02.192
[ whispering]:
Lumos Maxima.

00:01:02.236 --> 00:01:03.976
[ soft whirring]

00:01:04.020 --> 00:01:05.282
Lumos Maxima.

00:01:05.326 --> 00:01:08.329
[ high-pitched whir]

00:01:08.372 --> 00:01:09.852
Lumos Maxima!

00:01:09.895 --> 00:01:13.551
[ high-pitched whir]

00:01:22.908 --> 00:01:25.563
♪

00:01:34.616 --> 00:01:38.359
[ thunder rumbling]

00:01:38.663 --> 00:01:39.925
[ doorbell ringing]

00:01:39.969 --> 00:01:42.014
AUNT PETUNIA:
Harry! Harry! Harry!

00:01:42.058 --> 00:01:44.060
Open the door.

00:01:44.756 --> 00:01:46.497
[ rain pouring]

00:01:46.541 --> 00:01:48.630
[ sputtering]

00:01:48.673 --> 00:01:50.153
[ sighs]

00:01:50.197 --> 00:01:51.589
Marge, How lovely to see y--

00:01:51.633 --> 00:01:52.982
[ dog growls][ gasps]

00:01:53.025 --> 00:01:56.594
Uncle Vernon...
I need you to sign this form.

00:01:56.638 --> 00:01:58.030
What is it?

00:01:58.074 --> 00:02:00.337
Nothing. School stuff.

00:02:00.381 --> 00:02:03.035
Later perhaps, if you behave.

00:02:03.079 --> 00:02:04.689
I will if she does.

00:02:04.733 --> 00:02:08.476
Oh... you're still
here, are you?

00:02:08.519 --> 00:02:09.694
Yes.

00:02:09.738 --> 00:02:12.262
Don't say "yes" in
that ungrateful way.

00:02:12.306 --> 00:02:13.698
Damn good of my
brother to keep you.

00:02:13.742 --> 00:02:15.439
He'd've been straight
into an orphanage

00:02:15.483 --> 00:02:17.833
if he'd been dumped on
my doorstep, Vernon.

00:02:17.876 --> 00:02:19.008
[ Dudley laughs]

00:02:19.051 --> 00:02:20.705
Is that my Dudders?

00:02:20.749 --> 00:02:22.664
Is that my little neffy-poo?

00:02:22.707 --> 00:02:23.839
[ loud kisses]

00:02:23.882 --> 00:02:25.362
Give us a kiss!
Come on! Up, up, up!

00:02:25.406 --> 00:02:27.147
Oh, yes!Take Marge's
suitcase upstairs!

00:02:27.190 --> 00:02:28.539
Okay.

00:02:28.583 --> 00:02:30.715
MARGE:
That's a pup!

00:02:32.848 --> 00:02:34.719
MARGE:
Mm, finish that off for Mommy.

00:02:34.763 --> 00:02:36.199
There's a good boy, Rippy-poo.

00:02:36.243 --> 00:02:37.244
Mm.[ TV playing]

00:02:37.287 --> 00:02:38.462
VERNON:
Can I tempt you, Marge?

00:02:38.506 --> 00:02:40.290
MARGE:
Mm, just a small one.

00:02:40.334 --> 00:02:41.857
Excellent nosh, Petunia.

00:02:41.900 --> 00:02:43.989
Hey.
[ snaps fingers]

00:02:44.033 --> 00:02:45.904
Eh, a bit more.

00:02:45.948 --> 00:02:47.471
Usually just a
fry-up for me,

00:02:47.515 --> 00:02:49.604
what with 12 dogs.[ dog growls]

00:02:49.647 --> 00:02:52.868
A bit more.
That's a boy. Mmm.

00:02:52.911 --> 00:02:55.392
[ television playing]

00:02:55.436 --> 00:02:56.654
Ah. You want to try

00:02:56.698 --> 00:02:58.221
a little drop of brandy?
A little drop of

00:02:58.265 --> 00:03:02.051
brandy-brandy-windy-wandy
for Rippy-pippy-poo?

00:03:03.183 --> 00:03:04.314
What're you smirking at?

00:03:04.358 --> 00:03:07.361
Where is it you
send the boy, Vernon?

00:03:07.404 --> 00:03:08.710
Saint Brutus's.

00:03:08.753 --> 00:03:10.233
It's a fine institution
for hopeless cases.

00:03:10.277 --> 00:03:13.323
Do they use a cane at
Saint Brutus's, boy?

00:03:16.457 --> 00:03:21.462
Oh, yeah. Yeah, I've, I've been
beaten loads of times. Mm.

00:03:21.505 --> 00:03:22.550
MARGE:
Excellent.

00:03:22.593 --> 00:03:24.378
I won't have this namby-pamby

00:03:24.421 --> 00:03:25.640
wishy-washy nonsense

00:03:25.683 --> 00:03:27.076
about not beating people
who deserve it.

00:03:27.119 --> 00:03:28.469
But you mustn't blame yourself

00:03:28.512 --> 00:03:30.210
about how this one turned out,
Vernon.

00:03:30.253 --> 00:03:34.823
It's all to do with blood.
Bad blood will out.

00:03:34.866 --> 00:03:36.999
What is it the boy's father did,
Petunia?

00:03:37.042 --> 00:03:39.262
Nothing.
H-He didn't-he didn't work.

00:03:39.306 --> 00:03:40.394
He was, he was unemployed.

00:03:40.437 --> 00:03:42.134
And a drunk, too, no doubt?

00:03:42.178 --> 00:03:43.484
That's a lie!

00:03:43.527 --> 00:03:44.572
What did you say?

00:03:44.615 --> 00:03:46.313
My dad wasn't a drunk!

00:03:46.356 --> 00:03:48.402
[ gasps]

00:03:48.445 --> 00:03:50.273
Oh, don't worry.

00:03:50.317 --> 00:03:51.579
Don't fuss, Petunia.

00:03:51.622 --> 00:03:53.276
I have a very firm grip.

00:03:53.320 --> 00:03:55.104
I think it's time
you went to bed.

00:03:55.147 --> 00:03:56.279
Uh, quiet, Vernon.

00:03:56.323 --> 00:03:58.150
You... clean it up.

00:03:59.804 --> 00:04:00.631
Actually...

00:04:00.675 --> 00:04:01.937
[ sighs]

00:04:01.980 --> 00:04:03.112
...it's nothing to do
with the father.

00:04:03.155 --> 00:04:04.287
It's all to do with the mother.

00:04:04.331 --> 00:04:06.681
You see it all the time
with dogs.

00:04:06.724 --> 00:04:08.770
If there's something wrong
with the bitch,

00:04:08.813 --> 00:04:11.294
then there's something wrong
with the pup.

00:04:11.338 --> 00:04:13.078
Shut up! Shut up!

00:04:13.122 --> 00:04:15.385
Mm.[ dog whining]

00:04:17.996 --> 00:04:19.171
MARGE:
Right!

00:04:19.215 --> 00:04:22.610
Let me tell you... y-y--

00:04:22.653 --> 00:04:27.005
[ gurgling]

00:04:30.139 --> 00:04:33.751
[ ripping][ barking]

00:04:35.492 --> 00:04:39.104
[ groaning]

00:04:39.148 --> 00:04:41.106
[ gasping]

00:04:42.020 --> 00:04:43.631
[ cuckoos]

00:04:43.674 --> 00:04:44.632
MARGE:
Vernon!

00:04:44.675 --> 00:04:48.505
[ gasping and groaning]

00:04:48.549 --> 00:04:50.725
Vernon! Vernon, do something!

00:04:50.768 --> 00:04:51.987
[ growls]

00:04:52.030 --> 00:04:56.339
Ow! Let go of that, Ripper!
Ow!

00:04:56.383 --> 00:04:59.255
[ groaning]

00:05:02.389 --> 00:05:03.651
Ripper, get down,

00:05:03.694 --> 00:05:04.913
boy! Down!

00:05:04.956 --> 00:05:06.349
Ripper, stop it!

00:05:06.393 --> 00:05:08.220
[ groans]

00:05:09.047 --> 00:05:09.918
[ gasps]

00:05:09.961 --> 00:05:12.790
[ screaming]

00:05:15.880 --> 00:05:18.056
[ cuckoos]

00:05:18.100 --> 00:05:21.886
[ screaming]

00:05:23.714 --> 00:05:28.284
[ screaming]

00:05:32.593 --> 00:05:35.422
[ dog growling]Stop!

00:05:38.163 --> 00:05:40.035
I've got you, Marge!
I've got you!

00:05:40.078 --> 00:05:41.210
[ screams]

00:05:41.253 --> 00:05:43.778
[ growling]

00:05:45.823 --> 00:05:47.259
Get off.

00:05:47.912 --> 00:05:49.131
Don't you dare!

00:05:49.174 --> 00:05:51.699
Sorry![ Marge screams]

00:05:51.742 --> 00:05:54.354
Oh, Vernon! Oh, God!

00:05:54.397 --> 00:05:58.053
[ screaming]

00:06:03.580 --> 00:06:09.281
Please! Marge!

00:06:09.325 --> 00:06:13.547
[ tango music playing on TV]

00:06:22.251 --> 00:06:25.167
[ pants]

00:06:37.135 --> 00:06:38.441
You bring her back!

00:06:38.485 --> 00:06:39.790
You bring her back now
and you put her right!

00:06:39.834 --> 00:06:42.358
No! She deserved
what she got!

00:06:42.402 --> 00:06:43.446
[ yells]

00:06:43.490 --> 00:06:44.795
Keep away from me.

00:06:44.839 --> 00:06:46.449
You're not allowed
to do magic outside school.

00:06:46.493 --> 00:06:48.059
Yeah? Try me.

00:06:48.103 --> 00:06:50.975
They won't let you back now.
You've nowhere to go.

00:06:51.019 --> 00:06:52.150
I don't care.

00:06:52.194 --> 00:06:54.283
Anywhere's better than here.

00:07:00.332 --> 00:07:03.945
MARGE [ screaming]:
Help, would you! Help!

00:07:03.988 --> 00:07:07.557
[ panting]

00:07:15.260 --> 00:07:18.394
[ panting]

00:07:22.354 --> 00:07:26.097
[ dog barking in distance]

